  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fwarrior%253fr%253dcreateaeronautics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Better_Create_Aeronautics/MP_BetterCreateAeronautics_header.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"783\"></span></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">「Better Create Aeronautics」是一款以技術為主的模組整合包，專為喜歡建造、自動化與實驗《Create》系列（尤其是《Create Aeronautics》）所提供的一切內容的玩家打造。</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Better_Create_Aeronautics/MP_BetterCreateAeronautics_description.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"211\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">本整合包的目標不僅僅是為了添加機器而添加機器，而是讓世界感覺更加生動、探索起來更有趣。除了多款《Create》擴充模組外，還包含全新的生物群系、動物、建築結構、生物以及大量便利性提升，讓每次遊玩都更加完整豐富。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">您可以建造從小型生產線到大型工廠、複雜的自動化系統，甚至是功能齊全的飛行載具，以完全不同的方式環遊世界。同時，進度平衡性經過精心調整，確保單人與多人遊戲體驗都能流暢順暢。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Better_Create_Aeronautics/MP_BetterCreateAeronautics_screenshots.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1692/125/create-aeronautics-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1692/132/captura-de-pantalla-2026-05-21-191407.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">想和朋友一起遊玩嗎？</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fwarrior%253fr%253dcreateaeronautics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Better_Create_Aeronautics/MP_BetterCreateAeronautics_promo.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"267\"></span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">如果您想支持我與我的內容，我推薦您嘗試使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fwarrior%253fr%253dcreateaeronautics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></span></a>。新用戶使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fwarrior%253fr%253dcreateaeronautics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的專屬代碼即可享受首月遊戲伺服器 25% 折扣</strong></span></a>。他們提供全天候客服支援與極快的回應速度，讓您安心託管，並為您的所有遊戲需求提供卓越的協助。</span></p>",
